    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 An Orc Dark Mage with superior talent. He was once known as 'the Hope of the Breka Orc tribe,' but he was tricked into plotting against his leader, and exiled. Now, he dreams of the day he will take vengeance on those who betrayed and exiled him. He grows in power, and uses summoning magic learned from the Dark Elves to harness powerful servitors and minions. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Light Armor Type Lv. 3 Weak P. Def. and strong Evasion. Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
